    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎯 AI Lead Qualification & Routing System\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🎯 Purpose:\nCapture new form submissions, use AI to score and qualify \neach lead, then instantly notify the team and acknowledge \nthe customer.\n\n⚙️ How It Works:\n1. Google Sheets Trigger fires when a new form row is added.\n2. DeepSeek AI analyzes the inquiry and extracts:\n   Category, Intent, Budget, Urgency, UrgencyScore, Priority.\n3. Structured Output Parser forces clean JSON output.\n4. Merge combines the original form data + AI assessment.\n5. Three actions run in parallel:\n   → Gmail sends an acknowledgement to the customer.\n   → Telegram alerts the team with full lead details.\n   → Google Sheets logs the AI-scored lead for tracking.\n\n🧩 Nodes Used:\nGoogle Sheets Trigger → CategoryDefine (LLM Chain + DeepSeek \n+ Structured Output Parser) → Merge → Gmail (Ack to Client) \n+ Telegram (Team Alert) + Google Sheets (Append Scored Lead)\n\n💼 Business Value:\nReplaces manual lead triage. Leads are instantly scored, \nprioritized, and routed. Sales teams see hot leads first, \ncustomers get instant acknowledgement, and every lead is \nlogged with AI insights for follow-up.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━",
        "height": 784,
        "width": 592
